    <title>European Securities and Markets Authority (ESMA) | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="European Securities and Markets Authority (ESMA) | 110,754 followers on LinkedIn. EU authority responsible for enhancing investor protection, promoting orderly markets &amp;amp; ensuring financial stability. | ESMA is an independent EU Authority that was established in 2011.  It works closely with the national competent authorities who are members of the European System of Financial Supervision and the other European Supervisory Authorities – the European Banking Authority (EBA) responsible for banking and the European Insurance and Occupational Pensions Authority (EIOPA) responsible for insurance and occupational pensions.

Contact information: https://www.esma.europa.eu/contact-information">

