        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">🔵 ESMA has appointed <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/carlos-san-basilio-217799224?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Carlos San Basilio</a> (<a class="link" href="https://es.linkedin.com/company/cnmv?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>CNMV</a>), as the new member of its Management Board → <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dSwz2q7Y?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dSwz2q7Y</a>.

He replaces <a class="link" href="https://it.linkedin.com/in/carlo-comporti-9779254b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>carlo comporti</a> (<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/consob-official?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>CONSOB</a>), who will take up the role of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fesma&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ESMA</a> Chair on 1 November → <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dapveWRT?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dapveWRT</a>.

