    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">🥁 Meet <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fesma&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ESMA</a>’s next Chair: <a class="link" href="https://it.linkedin.com/in/carlo-comporti-9779254b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>carlo comporti</a> will take up the role on 1 November 2026 → <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dapveWRT?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dapveWRT</a>

With decades of experience in financial regulation and a strong understanding of ESMA, Carlo steps into the role at a pivotal time for the European financial markets.

👏 A heartfelt thank you to <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/verena-ross?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Verena Ross</a> for her outstanding leadership over the past five years and for helping shape ESMA into the organisation it is today.

We look forward to welcoming Carlo to the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fesmateam&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ESMAteam</a>!</p>
