    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">🎓 ESMA joined the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Feucareers&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#EUCareers</a> Fair organised by the <a class="link" href="https://se.linkedin.com/company/universitets-och-hogskoleradet?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Swedish Council for Higher Education (UHR)</a> in Stockholm, where more than 2,500 participants explored opportunities in the EU institutions.

⭐ Connecting with talented students and professionals allowed us to share a behind-the-scenes look at what it is like to work at ESMA. Thank you to everyone who stopped by!

📸 Check out a few highlights from the day 👇
📌 Learn more about <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fesmateam&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ESMAteam</a> → <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dhBvxPNW?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dhBvxPNW</a> </p>
