        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">🟢 Our new green finance dashboard for Q2 2026 is now live → <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dNdF6wxY?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dNdF6wxY</a>
Key findings show resilient <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fesg&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ESG</a> markets, though with mixed developments across segments, alongside growing ESG private fund assets and EU ESG bonds.

Take a look at the latest trends shaping <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsustainablefinance&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SustainableFinance</a>. 👇📊 The dashboard will be updated quarterly, providing a regular snapshot of developments across sustainable finance markets.</p>
