    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">🛡️ The review of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmica&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MiCA</a> offers an opportunity to strengthen the EU framework for <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcrypto&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#crypto</a>-assets. In our response to the <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/company/european-commission?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>European Commission</a>'s consultation, we set out recommendations to ensure the rules remain clear, safe, and capable of addressing emerging developments → <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/d3AS77QE?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/d3AS77QE</a>

🎯 The proposals aim to support investor protection, regulatory consistency, and innovation across the EU.
👇 Swipe through the slides to see our key recommendations.</p>
