  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">How can data support more effective supervision? What role will artificial intelligence, RegTech and SupTech play in the future of financial markets? And how can Europe make better use of regulatory data for investors and market participants?

⚡ Join us in Paris on 24 November 2026 for <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdataday&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#DataDay</a> to discuss the future of financial data and reporting. 🪑 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐝 𝐢𝐧 𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐨𝐧 𝐭𝐨 𝐠𝐞𝐭 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐟𝐮𝐥𝐥 𝐞𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞! Several sessions will take place in breakout rooms and will not be streamed or recorded, making on-site participation the only way to access all discussions and exchanges. Find more details about registration → <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/e_sCkgNm?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/e_sCkgNm</a> 

💬 The agenda (<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dC_u6FJQ?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dC_u6FJQ</a>) includes: 
- Keynote speech by <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/markus-ferber-mdep-6a1aa912?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Markus Ferber, MdEP</a>, Member of the <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/company/european-parliament?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>European Parliament</a>
-  Fireside chat with <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/nicolas-vasse-8b74b810?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Nicolas Vasse</a> (executive director, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/eu-amla?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>AMLA - The EU Anti-Money Laundering Authority</a>) and <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/natasha-cazenave-9832281?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Natasha Cazenave</a> (executive director, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fesma&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ESMA</a>)
- Discussions on AI, RegTech and SupTech, fund reporting, crypto monitoring under MiCA, transaction reporting, and ESAP
Dedicated break-out sessions and opportunities to engage directly with experts and peers </p>
