  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">In an environment marked by market volatility and shifting sovereign bond yields, how resilient are the safeguards that underpin short-term funding <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmarkets&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#markets</a>? 🔎 Our new working paper examines margin practices in European repo markets, drawing on <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsftr&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SFTR</a> data and evidence from recent episodes of stress in government bond markets → <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dxRcgJTW?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dxRcgJTW</a> 

💡 The findings provide new insights into how these risk buffers are used across different market segments and how they evolve during periods of market stress. Understanding these dynamics is key to assessing market resilience and financial stability.</p>
<!---->  </div>



        

        
            
      
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    

